__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
# Memory dumps and fitted arrays — regenerate them with tools/, don't commit them.
*.npz
*.bin
# ...except these two. Regenerating either means re-driving Edit.exe for dozens
# of renders, and one of them needs a body nobody here owns. The 7CM2 file is
# what build_tuning_ops.py reads to build what worker ships; the a7 V file is the
# cross-body control and the only ground truth we have for FL2/FL3.
!tools/look_tuning_perlook_7cm2.npz
!tools/look_tuning_a7v.npz
tools/sliderprobe_work.ARW
tools/sweep_work.ARW
tools/sliderprobe/*.npy
# 探针 dump 目录。同样是重跑 tools/ 就有的东西,而且里面还有 .json,
# 光靠上面的 *.npz / *.bin 拦不住 —— vatrprobe 一个就 27 MB。
tools/comboprobe/
tools/sharpprobe/
tools/vatrgrid/
tools/vatrprobe/
looksweep/
# 同理的几个大 dump(合计 4.7 MB),都只被写、没有脚本读它们。
# 注意 tools/spica_wtab.json **不在**此列 —— 那个是 spica_model/recon/match/
# export_tables 四个脚本的输入,删了就跑不起来。
tools/spica_trace.json
tools/spica_params.json
tools/spica_pass2.json
tools/spica_lbp.json
